## Dependencies
- PyQt5: `QMainWindow`, `QWidget`, `QVBoxLayout`, `QHBoxLayout`, `QPushButton`, `QLabel`, `QFrame`, `QApplication`, `QFileDialog`
- PyQt5.QtCore: `Qt`
- PyQt5.QtGui: `QPalette`, `QColor`, `QPixmap`
- External Modules:
  - `Image.load_image.return_image_path`
  - `API.ModelAPI.clf_model_connection_api.CLASSIFY_IMAGE_wBOTH_MODELS__for_btcm_mdl_v01s`
  - `API.ModelAPI.clf_model_connection_api.access_BOTH_models__for_btcm_mdl_v01s`

---
## Summary
This class provides an interactive PyQt5-based GUI for image classification. It includes sidebar navigation, theme toggling, and an image upload and classification workflow. The integration with external APIs allows model-based classification of images.

